# CARTO Basemap API Key (optional)
# As of August 2026, CARTO requires a free API key to use their basemap tiles without an "API KEY REQUIRED" watermark.
# You can get a free key instantly (with 5 million requests/month) at:
# https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey
#
# If left blank, the app automatically falls back to a clean, keyless grayscale canvas basemap.
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=
